IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CHECK-ELIGIBILITY.

DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 AGE      PIC S999.
    01 FLAG     PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT AGE.
    ACCEPT FLAG.

    IF AGE = 0 OR AGE > 120 OR AGE < 0 THEN
        DISPLAY 'INVALID AGE'
        STOP RUN
    END-IF.

    IF AGE >= 18 AND 
       (FLAG = 'Y' OR FLAG = 'y') THEN
        DISPLAY 'ELIGIBLE'
    ELSE
        DISPLAY 'NOT ELIGIBLE'
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
